    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "s2",
   "title": "Distance: add the lengths",
   "text": "The **distance** is the total path length: {{de|0}} + {{dn|0}} = {{dist|0}} m. It needs only a number and a unit, so it is a **scalar**.",
   "actions": [
    {
     "set": {
      "lv": 2
     },
     "at": 0
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "s3",
   "title": "Displacement: start to finish",
   "text": "The **displacement** is the straight arrow from start to finish: magnitude \\( \\sqrt{ {{de|0}}^2 + {{dn|0}}^2 } = {{disp|2}} \\) m, direction {{ang|1}}° north of east. It needs a direction too, so it is a **vector**.",
   "actions": [
    {
     "set": {
      "lv": 3
     },
     "at": 0
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "s4",
   "title": "Change the legs",
